{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":140,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by David."},{"n":1,"text":"Deliver me, LORD, from evil men. Preserve me from violent men:","tok":[{"t":"Deliver me, "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", from evil men. Preserve me from violent men:"}]},{"n":2,"text":"those who devise mischief in their hearts. They continually gather themselves together for war.","tok":[{"t":"those "},{"t":"who","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" devise "},{"t":"mischief","s":["H7451"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" hearts. "},{"t":"They","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"continually","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" gather "},{"t":"themselves","s":["H7451"]},{"t":" together "},{"t":"for","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" war."}]},{"n":3,"text":"They have sharpened their tongues like a serpent. Viper’s poison is under their lips. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"They","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" sharpened "},{"t":"their","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" tongues "},{"t":"like","s":["H2803"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" serpent. Viper’s poison "},{"t":"is","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"under","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" lips. Selah."}]},{"n":4,"text":"LORD, keep me from the hands of the wicked. Preserve me from the violent men who have determined to trip my feet.","tok":[{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", keep "},{"t":"me","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"from","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" hands "},{"t":"of","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H8478"]},{"t":". Preserve "},{"t":"me","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"from","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" violent men who "},{"t":"have","s":["H8193"]},{"t":" determined "},{"t":"to","s":["H2534"]},{"t":" trip "},{"t":"my","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" feet."}]},{"n":5,"text":"The proud have hidden a snare for me, they have spread the